  "open_findings": [
    "SR-10 high lock-boundary: development install never installs the lock provider or its PAM service",
    "SR-11 medium notifications: live notification map has no count bound (sandboxed-app memory exhaustion)",
    "SR-12 medium updates: CI mirror of the live APT repository is always empty (monotonic, retention and immutability checks bypassed)",
    "SR-13 medium dbus-polkit: keyd group membership gives every same-user process keyd's IPC (verify keyd 2.5.0 input/command scope)",
    "SR-14 low updates: rmac.pref does not lower other packages from the rmac origin",
    "SR-15 low packages: build-host paths embedded in shipped binaries",
    "SR-16 low packages: ci.yml actions pinned by tag, not commit",
    "SR-17 low packages: install.sh --from-release authenticity rests on HTTPS when gh is absent",
    "SR-18 low packages: release hardening (unpinned rustup/container/cargo-install inputs; publisher keyring source; manifest mode check)",
    "SR-19 low file-operations: Preview runs poppler tools without timeout or output cap",
    "SR-20 low desktop-entry-execution: relative desktop-entry Path= accepted",
    "SR-21 low file-operations: copy opens the source without O_NOFOLLOW after an lstat check",
    "SR-22 low dbus-polkit: NetworkManager secret agent and BlueZ pairing agent do not check the caller",
    "SR-23 low dbus-polkit: safe-mode notice accepts ActionInvoked from any sender",
    "SR-24 low dbus-polkit: MPRIS OpenUri unbounded and unvalidated",
    "SR-25 low dbus-polkit: no method-call timeouts on outgoing D-Bus calls",
    "SR-26 low dbus-polkit: keyboard helper reports polkit denial as cancellation",
    "SR-27 low lock-boundary: recovery runbook describes the old swaylock unit"
